  "description": "Removal of existing roof tiles and battens down to the sarking board, retain existing sarking boards and rafters below. Provision of a bat friendly breather membrane over the existing sarking boards and replace battens and rooftiles with like for like materials. An upgrade of the U-value to comply with the current building regulations is also proposed, by installing insulation between and below rafters. \nThe existing lead cladding, flasings and linings have not been installed in accordance with the current Lead Sheet Association Guidance. It is also proposed to replace these items like for like with a compliant installation.\n",
